INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (8.9,102,2024,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMwhWailP1WY7sb6AoE6b8ugoy.jpg','UA','tmdb-1007757','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHhxWxge06goXU6ZQH1hj7vK8Hd.jpg','Recommended','A small woodland creature and a majestic bird, two natural sworn enemies of the Valley, magically trade places and set off on an adventure of a lifetime to switch back. Their journey soon uncovers a greater threat—one that could endanger not only their species, but the entire valley they call home.','Swapped','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=glgmAwRDP8s'),(6.8,108,1158,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/54KIfdTEzOliHDKx0OkzYGqAICx.jpg','UA','tmdb-1081003','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QCWdqzTfh2x9UylVpspIU6QTuM.jpg','Now Showing','When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.','Supergirl','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oBjvsGAU6KY'),(7.1,111,2317,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjwMC7u3xWKkrronolBqsIy4L0L.jpg','UA','tmdb-1083381','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg','Trending','A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.','Backrooms','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5C-zBIuvGnU'),(7.4,102,728,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sSKdEmlmqF4kJUd28SqthXC4yZ.jpg','UA','tmdb-1084244','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg','Now Showing','When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang\'s jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.','Toy Story 5','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLn3HlVwLW0'),(5.9,115,155,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg','UA','tmdb-1108427','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKVgiv5qHCvCLT4A2ymJi5QeXDH.jpg','Now Showing','Teenage Moana answers the Ocean\'s call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.','Moana','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oft7rwwiZ9o'),(6.7,143,97,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fVV0A67kDjTTQ4CvUn8LoletRmI.jpg','UA','tmdb-1112426','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfnhwfUEFuSOxxf4jDdBlY6Lccw.jpg','Now Showing','Following the events of \'Stree\', the town of Chanderi is being haunted again. This time, women are mysteriously abducted by a terrifying headless entity. Once again, it\'s up to Vicky and friends to save their town and loved ones.','Stree 2','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VlvOgk5BHS4'),(7.6,97,594,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg','UA','tmdb-1122573','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg','Upcoming','A covert team of elite operatives are living in the shadows. When a ruthless despot steals a billion-dollar fortune, they\'re sent to take it back—an impossible heist that erupts into a deadly game of strategy, deception and survival.','In the Grey','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TEyz-nm8Wlk'),(7.2,107,324,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szKv713FcUXx6hcfdY369vtkmzr.jpg','UA','tmdb-1127384','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjcuS7xaRyqRjVaVcH4t0qHshuX.jpg','Upcoming','A group of international passengers on a flight from Los Angeles to Shanghai is forced to make an emergency landing in shark-infested waters. The terrified group is forced to work together and overcome their differences if they hope to escape their sinking plane and the frenzy of sharks drawn to the wreckage.','Deep Water','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pa60ImSofQQ'),(5.1,170,25,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96chPcURxg5thGyLqxO6otyxHFR.jpg','UA','tmdb-1169516','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JlfUuvvX5xLP2LIDah4JhWUtTx.jpg','Trending','A group of quirky characters gets stuck in a dangerous jungle during a chaotic mission. Filled with confusion, criminals, and hilarious situations, they must work together to survive and find their way out.','Welcome to the Jungle','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ'),(7.1,161,58,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s37s21YPqS7txyB0x0TRel24vgi.jpg','UA','tmdb-1196943','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubRsrzb6NRW8YhVTJ6jG1kpNvCi.jpg','Trending','Shivaji\'s death sparks the Maratha-Mughal conflict. His son Sambhaji leads resistance against Aurangzeb\'s forces. Amid battles and intrigue, both sides face challenges in a struggle for power.','Chhaava','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F6dGg2JX8Lc'),(7.4,201,31,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fzo85eKFEjfmJ781gubJQjpQAwF.jpg','UA','tmdb-1213898','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmrCgmDPEJ6QxllS1rhjYwgO9Wb.jpg','Now Showing','Three idealistic soldiers in the Indian army, navy and air force face grueling combat conditions in this film set during the 1971 Indo-Pak war.','Border 2','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nvmc2ECk8Lo'),(7,208,323,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8aYAfAPolsRFrHbP1rafeSgg2Ew.jpg','UA','tmdb-12259','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya9bwgqA4eNl5bQ9QqS0jcmRoBS.jpg','Trending','After his family is slain by notorious bandit Gabbar Singh, former Inspector Thakur Baldev Singh enlists low-level outlaws Jai and Veeru to capture Gabbar and seek revenge.','Sholay','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RDY97iu1_q8'),(5.6,163,54,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A2tzVTVtnTvpji96IZmleN78KKv.jpg','UA','tmdb-1239134','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArIS4vwUxdhm3j7tsTHmffdfU8W.jpg','Now Showing','A man inherits a palace in rural Mangalpur and plans his sister\'s wedding there, but strange supernatural events and panicked locals force him to investigate the property\'s mysterious past.','Bhooth Bangla','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XW1RkKiRnsg'),(7.4,146,2056,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/flxau5Iu7bChQHsESqvGZ3FQRaI.jpg','UA','tmdb-1275779','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg','Trending','A cybersecurity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there\'s life beyond our understanding.','Disclosure Day','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gtRK1WxhzI'),(6.6,123,135,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aM3pduSU53VjcALWOfLWNw8v2TI.jpg','UA','tmdb-1284465','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13MmRwmG5NmaMfU8qNrtgGXisiD.jpg','Now Showing','Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.','The Death of Robin Hood','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GSfq5jq7ChQ'),(0,109,0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ddrLCUT8hqSlEICTTbdlFYB5q4a.jpg','UA','tmdb-1307247','Korean','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbrWXB9yb5aEdt4peVy8OWNP2Y.jpg','Upcoming','Six years after the Hawaii airplane hijacking, Mi-yeong finds herself struggling with her rebellious teenage daughter, Nari, and her unemployed husband, Seok-hwan. When Hyun-min, a flight attendant she met during the hijacking, invites her family to his wedding aboard a luxury cruise ship, Mi-yeong eagerly proposes a family holiday. Met with indifference from her husband and daughter, she decides to embark alone, joining Hyun-min\'s family and Ji-hoon, a charming magician. However, on the eve of the wedding, the celebration turns deadly when armed assailants seize the ship. After Seok-hwan and Nari are kidnapped and brought aboard, Mi-yeong discovers that she is the target of a much larger plot.','OK! Madam: Bon Voyage','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ'),(8.4,156,1350,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RgPyOhN4DRs225BGTlHJqCudII.jpg','UA','tmdb-1311031','Japanese','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWVSwgjpT2D78VUh6X8UBd2rorW.jpg','Trending','The Demon Slayer Corps are drawn into the Infinity Castle, where Tanjiro, Nezuko, and the Hashira face terrifying Upper Rank demons in a desperate fight as the final battle against Muzan Kibutsuji begins.','Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Infinity Castle','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpAlHmuA2YM'),(6.4,90,244,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg','UA','tmdb-1315772','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz7i42yhLIJ4ve9JKgM6NthoLHO.jpg','Trending','This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.','Minions & Monsters','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a_G7XFjggI8'),(8.2,109,3952,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lTZyuBTNOfawsfPT8Q0cIg6qAF.jpg','UA','tmdb-1339713','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg','Now Showing','After breaking the mysterious \"One Wish Willow\" to win his crush\'s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.','Obsession','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vGagNXaSoWc'),(7.9,173,1865,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/RMXG8myu1aGlNUsRjtxzmpdMK0.jpg','UA','tmdb-1368337','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg','Now Showing','Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.','The Odyssey','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p6W3EWqpvZ4'),(8.1,123,317,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg','UA','tmdb-1375646','Korean','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg','Trending','Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.','Colony','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LW6dpj1uCK8'),(5.2,110,19,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9sVh1AVFF5GLs7huOoZdVga07.jpg','UA','tmdb-1469342','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wnVNRLVZo9T258sb9KYMwizTCE.jpg','Upcoming','When a mysterious mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis, unleashing a deadly and elusive entity, a troubled young woman searches for her father. Her quest collides with an American GI on a harrowing odyssey to rescue his daughter from Hell.','Her Private Hell','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C7E-0t1TfzM'),(5.9,106,16,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/J1UgJwRxDQS92kw75KgeVFZMHf.jpg','UA','tmdb-1491920','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QgJQrClh9ej357yzLWgCxrjAmJ.jpg','Upcoming','The \"Supreme Invincible Cup\" is about to begin, and a host of top teams are about to engage in an unprecedented showdown! But the Kung Fu Women\'s Soccer Team has been dealt a hellish script right from the start?! Their opponents are all highly skilled, and external pressure is mounting. The schemes on the field are one after another... Can they use their kung fu to turn the tide on the green field?','Kung Fu Soccer','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ'),(0,145,0,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lB7yPaRhJHQ9dx7AnvPUi0GZDU.jpg','UA','tmdb-1516698','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pego3yEZ5SuGvRjESKAguL4Wu7M.jpg','Upcoming','Ry, a college student with a chronic illness escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer\'s end is threatened.','The Last Sunrise','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NhI2UpkFAFw'),(7.1,134,118,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1x9e0qWonw634NhIsRdvnneeqvN.jpg','UA','tmdb-1523145','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wIBfBl2gejt6xHxNSK0reVIm7E.jpg','Upcoming','High school student Polina is saved from bullying at her new school and makes a deal with the main bully Bars: he must pretend to be her boyfriend and protect her, and she must do everything he says. During this game, the couple develops real feelings, but her family and classmates have reasons to separate the lovers.','Your Heart Will Be Broken','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ'),(6.4,88,68,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y8zWGEjs7tresw4Hzkkf4TdkcL.jpg','UA','tmdb-1564614','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAsZvBygplNpp8PtjoTEYv3VPB.jpg','Upcoming','Two teenage boys must escape a violent entity that takes the form of the person they desire most — each other.','Leviticus','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WXuK0vlFxII'),(6.5,134,23,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dk68ykaNd3HdrDJyPJqEGsgvag7.jpg','UA','tmdb-1630409','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qADBUb5ybrkRVGZEFF8Z4RuOwys.jpg','Trending','Tormented by past mistakes and a terminal diagnosis, an ex-debt collector returns to the underworld to protect the victims of a violent organization.','The Debt Collector','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U9vJ2Z4SFQI'),(9,110,331,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iCML6fBe3X0y06P33bM7dyYXPKZ.jpg','UA','tmdb-1632181','Spanish','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0CIVzeR7hRAPBPGR54qDZoOQpp.jpg','Recommended','Two women discover they were both scammed by the same man (who also got them pregnant). They form an alliance to take revenge.','Accidental Partners','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tsjsPgnCM2U'),(7,94,6,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wPSOPYy2fV62GjeXpVdKyweZGZu.jpg','UA','tmdb-1727780','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAA2mjpYJFAKydtzG4P4aHC4mZk.jpg','Trending','Convinced they are our secret saviors, rogue U.S. operatives abduct Mexican gang members and seed them across major American cities, unleashing criminal chaos, swaying voters by playing on nativist prejudices, and forcing law enforcement into a race to expose the plot as the escalating carnage threatens democracy itself.','Borderline','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ORHBgSvX_24'),(8.7,175,23235,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tSPT36ZKlP2WVHJLM4cQPLSzv3b.jpg','UA','tmdb-238','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg','Recommended','Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.','The Godfather','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ew9ngL1GZvs'),(8.6,202,14100,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kGzFbGhp99zva6oZODW5atUtnqi.jpg','UA','tmdb-240','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hek3koDUyRQk7FIhPXsa6mT2Zc3.jpg','Recommended','In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.','The Godfather Part II','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7pfqivkYUlE'),(8.7,142,30890,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfbjgQE1uSd9wiPTX4VzsLi0rGG.jpg','UA','tmdb-278','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg','Recommended','Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.','The Shawshank Redemption','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PLl99DlL6b4'),(7.9,161,1181,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l0fNAHLOFReQJsxCOmGWvJDnimn.jpg','UA','tmdb-360814','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJRPOLEexI7qp2DKtFfCh7YaaUG.jpg','Now Showing','Dangal is an extraordinary true story based on the life of Mahavir Singh and his two daughters, Geeta and Babita Phogat. The film traces the inspirational journey of a father who trains his daughters to become world class wrestlers.','Dangal','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9jyD4Ykbq8Y'),(8.6,195,17664,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zb6fM1CX41D9rF9hdgclu0peUmy.jpg','UA','tmdb-424','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sF1U4EUQS8YHUYjNl3pMGNIQyr0.jpg','Recommended','The true story of how businessman Oskar Schindler saved over a thousand Jewish lives from the Nazis while they worked as slaves in his factory during World War II.','Schindler\'s List','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v0RB-3sWbBA'),(7.3,141,1358,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/piV2OnzTZCyGBP9JCjlHIgKGlfo.jpg','UA','tmdb-454639','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg','Trending','After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.','Masters of the Universe','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lBnfz93v27Q'),(8.7,157,6615,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Tfys3mDZVp4tNoH2ktm06a0Tau.jpg','UA','tmdb-687163','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yihdXomYb5kTeSivtFndMy5iDmf.jpg','Recommended','Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.','Project Hail Mary','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eSGTui-T-4Q'),(6.1,201,199,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lprsAHkwMxk2iC6VZxNmV0H7g1t.jpg','UA','tmdb-781732','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr9rjR3J0xBBKmlJ4n3gHId9ccx.jpg','Trending','The hardened son of a powerful industrialist returns home after years abroad and vows to take bloody revenge on those threatening his father\'s life.','Animal','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ'),(6.4,176,183,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o8XSR1SONnjcsv84NRu6Mwsl5io.jpg','UA','tmdb-801688','Telugu','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rstcAnBeCkxNQjNp3YXrF6IP1tW.jpg','Now Showing','In the year 2898 AD, around 6000 years after Kurukshetra war, Ashwatthama gears up for his final battle of redemption at the sign of hope in a dystopian world and Bhairava, a wisecracking and self-interested bounty hunter, tired of the perilous life becomes the hurdle in the process.','Kalki 2898-AD','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eWI9voiOt_k'),(6.4,146,263,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9wRAIQeOv2qzcgpfvA4dYZKeezl.jpg','UA','tmdb-864692','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arf00BkwvXo0CFKbaD9OpqdE4Nu.jpg','Now Showing','A soldier caught by enemies and presumed dead comes back to complete his mission, accompanied by old companions and foes.','Pathaan','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yswBxKPFSvA'),(7,169,337,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5LtSjMNw6j3LkG29Oa4O0iY5U8.jpg','UA','tmdb-872906','Hindi','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFt1gS4BGHlK8xt76Y81Alp4dbt.jpg','Trending','An emotional journey of a prison warden, driven by a personal vendetta while keeping up to a promise made years ago, recruits inmates to commit outrageous crimes that shed light on corruption and injustice, in an attempt to get even with his past,  and that leads him to an unexpected reunion.','Jawan','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MWOlnZSnXJo'),(8.7,128,3779,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg','UA','tmdb-936075','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm0KAbOjlt9eR5y7vDiL2dEOwMl.jpg','Recommended','The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.','Michael','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9h7-znnwxeA'),(8,145,324,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vjMvFSmGUxEtqVdaZgvFee9XkZl.jpg','UA','tmdb-969681','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPOn6DinuVyLY17YM9mKuPofV08.jpg','Now Showing','Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn\'t remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.','Spider-Man: Brand New Day','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J8eK7cJah3c'),(9.4,99,493,'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg','UA','tmdb-980431','English','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg','Now Showing','Avatar Aang, the world\'s last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.','Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7b20GRFZBFE');
